1
00:00:00,025 --> 00:00:01,525
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,527 --> 00:00:03,014
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,525 --> 00:00:05,525
(Episode 69)

4
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:09,421
You asked to see me?

5
00:00:10,797 --> 00:00:11,928
Yes. Sit down.

6
00:00:12,472 --> 00:00:13,472
Okay.

7
00:00:17,061 --> 00:00:18,200
Earlier today,

8
00:00:18,651 --> 00:00:21,924
I saw your mom make Ji Hu kneel
and hit him.

9
00:00:22,695 --> 00:00:24,168
I couldn't believe it.

10
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:26,435
- I'm sorry.
- Don't interrupt me.

11
00:00:27,012 --> 00:00:30,816
Then, after I got home,
she walked in completely soaked.

12
00:00:31,032 --> 00:00:33,772
She said you poured water on her
while she was in the restroom.

13
00:00:34,512 --> 00:00:36,072
Have you always been such a bully?

14
00:00:36,432 --> 00:00:38,681
I was so shocked, Mother.

15
00:00:39,483 --> 00:00:41,609
Her dad spoiled her rotten.

16
00:00:41,811 --> 00:00:42,811
Her dad?

17
00:00:44,196 --> 00:00:46,047
Yeong Ju's ex-husband.

18
00:00:48,168 --> 00:00:52,692
He had an affair, but apparently
he adored his mistress's daughter.

19
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:54,920
I can't believe it.

20
00:00:55,212 --> 00:00:56,970
Honey, I don't know what to say.

21
00:00:57,437 --> 00:01:00,056
There's no need for a long talk, Ji Ni.

22
00:01:00,781 --> 00:01:02,041
Leave Ji Hu.

23
00:01:02,772 --> 00:01:05,152
I know a lot has happened,

24
00:01:05,528 --> 00:01:08,350
but stop while I'm still asking nicely.
If you keep this up...

25
00:01:08,352 --> 00:01:10,066
You'll just be his mistress.

26
00:01:10,392 --> 00:01:11,877
Who do you think you are...

27
00:01:11,878 --> 00:01:14,725
to challenge the marriage we approved?
How dare you?

28
00:01:14,786 --> 00:01:15,935
Who do you think you are?

29
00:01:16,683 --> 00:01:18,375
This is unbelievable.

30
00:01:19,168 --> 00:01:21,110
She must be used to living as a mistress.

31
00:01:21,432 --> 00:01:23,241
I'd have ended it already.

32
00:01:23,892 --> 00:01:25,297
Why would I be a mistress?

33
00:01:25,758 --> 00:01:27,858
Doesn't your mom's life scare you?

34
00:01:27,946 --> 00:01:29,343
I'm not scared of a thief.

35
00:01:29,345 --> 00:01:31,025
Listen to her!

36
00:01:31,272 --> 00:01:33,500
We told you we approved their marriage.

37
00:01:33,502 --> 00:01:37,208
It seems your mom
doesn't approve of Ji Hu either,

38
00:01:37,584 --> 00:01:38,883
so it's best for everyone.

39
00:01:39,072 --> 00:01:40,244
Don't cause any more trouble.

40
00:01:40,245 --> 00:01:41,530
Please.

41
00:01:41,532 --> 00:01:43,637
You've turned our house upside down.

42
00:01:43,683 --> 00:01:47,524
What spell did you put on him
to make him willing to die for you?

43
00:01:47,935 --> 00:01:51,133
That's what bothers me most.

44
00:01:51,526 --> 00:01:52,987
Me too, Mother.

45
00:01:53,532 --> 00:01:56,104
When I think back to Ji Hu jumping
in front of the car for her...

46
00:01:57,795 --> 00:01:59,906
I feel like it'll leave me traumatized.

47
00:02:01,507 --> 00:02:02,643
Why are you staring?

48
00:02:04,882 --> 00:02:06,383
Go home.

49
00:02:20,402 --> 00:02:21,957
Please just go.

50
00:02:22,241 --> 00:02:25,256
I'm cold. I just want to put on a coat.
What's the problem?

51
00:02:25,357 --> 00:02:26,906
Su Yeon, really...

52
00:02:36,819 --> 00:02:37,845
Ji Ni.

53
00:02:38,488 --> 00:02:39,528
When did you get here?

54
00:02:39,755 --> 00:02:40,961
Ma'am.

55
00:02:42,416 --> 00:02:44,339
Why are you back? Didn't you go shopping?

56
00:02:44,515 --> 00:02:46,418
What's going on here?

57
00:02:47,056 --> 00:02:48,076
Sun Kyung.

58
00:02:48,969 --> 00:02:50,101
Joong Bin.

59
00:02:52,291 --> 00:02:53,334
Ji Ni.

60
00:02:55,178 --> 00:02:56,650
Look at her.

61
00:02:56,652 --> 00:02:59,905
She acted tough until you showed up.
Now come the tears. Unbelievable.

62
00:02:59,952 --> 00:03:02,289
You're quite the little schemer.

63
00:03:03,072 --> 00:03:04,330
Stay out of this, Yeong Ju.

64
00:03:04,332 --> 00:03:05,592
It's about my daughter-in-law.

65
00:03:05,594 --> 00:03:08,132
How can I see this and not interfere?

66
00:03:09,183 --> 00:03:12,318
Isn't this going too far, Joong Bin?

67
00:03:13,328 --> 00:03:14,939
- Who do you think you are?
- Me?

68
00:03:15,912 --> 00:03:17,680
I'm Ji Hu's wife.

69
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:21,151
As his official wife, I'm warning her
against becoming his mistress.

70
00:03:22,212 --> 00:03:23,908
You'd know. You're the veteran here.

71
00:03:23,909 --> 00:03:25,124
The veteran?

72
00:03:26,749 --> 00:03:28,556
Don't call yourself his official wife.

73
00:03:28,557 --> 00:03:29,920
You got there by stealing.

74
00:03:30,852 --> 00:03:31,953
Joong Bin.

75
00:03:32,687 --> 00:03:34,973
Who exactly are you choosing to believe?

76
00:03:35,233 --> 00:03:37,020
Ji Hu says he never gave her his ID.

77
00:03:37,127 --> 00:03:39,557
- Why do you believe Do Hee?
- Yeong Ju.

78
00:03:39,559 --> 00:03:41,809
He says Ji Ni is the woman he loves.

79
00:03:41,918 --> 00:03:43,711
You've all gone too far.

80
00:03:44,575 --> 00:03:45,874
Joong Bin. Sun Kyung.

81
00:03:46,470 --> 00:03:48,407
I'm the one Ji Ni's mom humiliated...

82
00:03:48,634 --> 00:03:50,336
not either of you.

83
00:03:50,708 --> 00:03:52,153
I'm the victim,
yet I want to accept Ji Ni...

84
00:03:52,154 --> 00:03:54,373
because I know how sweet and good she is.

85
00:03:54,907 --> 00:03:57,699
What gives either of you the right
to be so cruel to her?

86
00:03:58,125 --> 00:04:01,791
Even my children have accepted her
as their younger sister.

87
00:04:02,250 --> 00:04:04,119
That's how powerful blood ties are.

88
00:04:04,458 --> 00:04:07,291
That's why you must be careful
about who you bring into the family.

89
00:04:08,416 --> 00:04:11,958
Joong Bin, how could you say that?

90
00:04:13,041 --> 00:04:14,333
Ji Ni.

91
00:04:15,041 --> 00:04:16,416
Let's talk later.

92
00:04:19,375 --> 00:04:20,694
Don't go, Ji Hu.

93
00:04:21,029 --> 00:04:22,669
We're ending this today.

94
00:04:22,898 --> 00:04:24,207
You're already legally married.

95
00:04:24,291 --> 00:04:27,083
So you called Ji Ni here
to humiliate her in front of Do Hee?

96
00:04:27,125 --> 00:04:29,490
Ji Hu, she dumped water on me!

97
00:04:29,492 --> 00:04:31,436
Tell them what you did in middle school.

98
00:04:31,596 --> 00:04:33,032
That's only fair.

99
00:04:33,666 --> 00:04:36,625
I was young. I just took a prank too far.

100
00:04:36,666 --> 00:04:38,250
Did Ji Ni think it was a prank too?

101
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:41,890
A joke is only a joke
when both people enjoy it.

102
00:04:42,275 --> 00:04:44,816
And love is only love
when both people feel it.

103
00:04:45,458 --> 00:04:46,792
Right, Dad?

104
00:04:48,291 --> 00:04:50,746
No, it wasn't me.

105
00:04:51,375 --> 00:04:54,346
Dad, you don't believe
anything I say anymore, do you?

106
00:04:54,741 --> 00:04:56,866
It doesn't matter who poured the water.

107
00:04:56,916 --> 00:04:59,833
This happened because you keep breaking
a promise you made long ago.

108
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:03,166
I stand by my people to the very end.

109
00:05:03,266 --> 00:05:06,023
I lost my memory.
And Do Hee was the reason.

110
00:05:06,708 --> 00:05:09,102
You're supposed to protect me.
How can you both do this?

111
00:05:16,396 --> 00:05:18,047
Honey, did you see that?

112
00:05:18,048 --> 00:05:20,067
I told you Ji Hu has changed.

113
00:05:39,166 --> 00:05:42,950
Don't waste your tears on them.
Go straight home and get some rest.

114
00:05:43,291 --> 00:05:44,709
My aunt will go with you.

115
00:05:45,375 --> 00:05:47,986
I only stayed to speak with my dad,

116
00:05:48,123 --> 00:05:49,344
so please don't be hurt.

117
00:05:49,708 --> 00:05:50,833
Okay?

118
00:05:56,091 --> 00:05:58,299
I'm not crying. Don't worry.

119
00:06:06,958 --> 00:06:08,541
(I'm not crying. Don't worry.)

120
00:06:42,166 --> 00:06:43,250
Ji Hu.

121
00:06:45,158 --> 00:06:47,907
Uncle, I can't keep living here.

122
00:06:48,758 --> 00:06:50,640
They'll use this to say we lived together.

123
00:06:51,158 --> 00:06:52,348
It's a trap.

124
00:06:53,948 --> 00:06:57,115
I know, but you can't go to Seo Chon now.
If you do that...

125
00:06:57,125 --> 00:06:58,248
Don't worry.

126
00:06:58,568 --> 00:07:00,333
I'll stay at Tae O's place or a hotel.

127
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:02,192
Okay.

128
00:07:15,732 --> 00:07:17,690
Your mom was right.
You have really changed.

129
00:07:17,790 --> 00:07:20,873
What more am I supposed to do
when my parents won't believe me?

130
00:07:20,875 --> 00:07:23,958
Ji Hu, marriage joins two families.

131
00:07:24,832 --> 00:07:26,041
Two families...

132
00:07:29,083 --> 00:07:31,208
- Then who is my family?
- Im Ji Hu.

133
00:07:32,166 --> 00:07:33,211
I...

134
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,677
I know you adopted me.

135
00:07:39,375 --> 00:07:40,416
Ji Hu.

136
00:07:46,458 --> 00:07:48,069
I'll protect your family, Dad.

137
00:07:48,221 --> 00:07:49,902
That's why I've put up with everything.

138
00:07:51,166 --> 00:07:54,840
You took me in when I was abandoned.
I wanted to repay you.

139
00:07:55,050 --> 00:07:56,133
When did you find out?

140
00:07:56,666 --> 00:07:57,875
It was the fall of my junior year.

141
00:07:58,583 --> 00:08:00,307
I was heading home after school...

142
00:08:00,533 --> 00:08:02,315
when the woman who claimed to be
my birth mother showed up.

143
00:08:03,666 --> 00:08:05,375
She had a DNA test report.

144
00:08:06,708 --> 00:08:08,371
She must've looked into me beforehand.

145
00:08:12,208 --> 00:08:13,840
Otherwise, I wouldn't have believed her.

146
00:08:14,333 --> 00:08:16,767
I never felt much warmth from mom,

147
00:08:17,768 --> 00:08:19,825
but I never imagined
she wasn't my birth mother.

148
00:08:21,666 --> 00:08:23,500
While my maternal grandma was raising me,

149
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,833
she'd say, "I feel sorry for your mom.
She's sick. That's why she's like that."

150
00:08:27,875 --> 00:08:29,336
So you knew all along.

151
00:08:29,458 --> 00:08:30,711
Yes. I pretended I didn't.

152
00:08:31,916 --> 00:08:35,583
I told myself you were good people,
just like my real parents,

153
00:08:36,666 --> 00:08:38,750
and tried to repay you, as grandma said.

154
00:08:38,866 --> 00:08:40,509
That's what Do Hee meant to me.

155
00:08:41,458 --> 00:08:42,708
Because you two liked her.

156
00:08:42,791 --> 00:08:44,250
- What about you?
- Me?

157
00:08:45,616 --> 00:08:47,346
When I could no longer play the piano,

158
00:08:47,839 --> 00:08:49,971
I gave up on the life I wanted.

159
00:08:50,424 --> 00:08:52,632
That's what brought Ji Ni and me together.

160
00:08:54,125 --> 00:08:57,500
Ji Ni was just as hopeless as I was.

161
00:08:58,958 --> 00:09:00,746
My aunt helped her.

162
00:09:02,454 --> 00:09:04,125
She'd given up on life herself.

163
00:09:04,232 --> 00:09:06,047
Giving up is for losers.

164
00:09:06,048 --> 00:09:07,369
You don't have to give up.

165
00:09:08,166 --> 00:09:09,963
You're the biggest coward, Dad.

166
00:09:10,541 --> 00:09:14,059
You hide behind mom and only care
about your ambition and reputation.

167
00:09:14,283 --> 00:09:16,991
I'd rather admit I'm an orphan
and move forward.

168
00:09:19,083 --> 00:09:21,123
You ungrateful brat!
After all I've done to raise you!

169
00:09:26,166 --> 00:09:28,457
It's humiliating to say this,

170
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:32,015
but I was a pet.

171
00:09:32,458 --> 00:09:34,343
When mom was happy, I had to smile.

172
00:09:34,344 --> 00:09:35,642
When she was depressed,

173
00:09:36,916 --> 00:09:38,625
I wasn't even allowed out of my room.

174
00:09:40,391 --> 00:09:41,933
You were never home, Dad.

175
00:09:43,949 --> 00:09:45,741
That still doesn't justify this.

176
00:09:46,916 --> 00:09:48,961
If you call Ji Ni back
and humiliate her again,

177
00:09:50,021 --> 00:09:51,711
I'll tell mom this time.

178
00:09:52,708 --> 00:09:56,115
I'll tell her I know everything.
I remember...

179
00:09:57,458 --> 00:09:58,499
all the abuse I suffered.

180
00:09:58,500 --> 00:09:59,777
You can't do that.

181
00:09:59,875 --> 00:10:01,666
Your mom couldn't handle it.

182
00:10:03,675 --> 00:10:05,186
That's up to you, Dad.

183
00:10:39,249 --> 00:10:41,127
Your daughter won't be able
to show her face, either.

184
00:10:41,791 --> 00:10:43,502
I'll make sure everyone condemns her.

185
00:10:43,791 --> 00:10:46,000
She'll learn what her parents' affair
does to a child...

186
00:10:46,758 --> 00:10:49,875
and feel it firsthand
for the rest of her life.

187
00:11:08,941 --> 00:11:10,041
Ji Ni.

188
00:11:10,977 --> 00:11:12,100
Are you going out?

189
00:11:14,333 --> 00:11:16,000
Ji Hu's here.

190
00:11:16,208 --> 00:11:17,604
Really?

191
00:11:18,581 --> 00:11:20,390
Okay. Go see him.

192
00:11:22,325 --> 00:11:23,525
Ji Ni,

193
00:11:24,852 --> 00:11:28,583
are you going to tell Ji Hu
you want to break up?

194
00:11:30,924 --> 00:11:32,465
I'm not sure.

195
00:11:44,175 --> 00:11:45,550
Ji Hu.

196
00:11:54,174 --> 00:11:57,758
You're hurt again? What's with the bag?

197
00:11:59,315 --> 00:12:01,024
I'm staying somewhere else for a while.

198
00:12:02,250 --> 00:12:04,291
I can't stay in a house with Do Hee.

199
00:12:04,899 --> 00:12:07,565
The attorney told me
to keep my distance, remember?

200
00:12:09,333 --> 00:12:10,525
It seems...

201
00:12:11,344 --> 00:12:14,228
they really do want Do Do Hee
as their daughter-in-law.

202
00:12:15,798 --> 00:12:18,257
I told them if they liked her so much,
they could live with her, and left.

203
00:12:20,166 --> 00:12:22,677
Even after I said I never gave her my ID,
they kept pressuring me.

204
00:12:22,958 --> 00:12:24,536
They called you over
just to call you a mistress...

205
00:12:27,316 --> 00:12:28,630
They were so rude to you.

206
00:12:32,125 --> 00:12:35,755
Should we stop seeing each other
for a while?

207
00:12:36,375 --> 00:12:37,458
Ji Ni.

208
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,313
I'm not saying we should break up.

209
00:12:40,716 --> 00:12:43,799
Neither my mom nor your parents
want us to be together.

210
00:12:44,433 --> 00:12:46,099
Just while the lawsuit is going on.

211
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,541
Are you scared?

212
00:12:52,175 --> 00:12:53,675
Honestly, yes.

213
00:12:55,916 --> 00:12:57,791
Words like "mistress"
and "affair partner."

214
00:12:59,024 --> 00:13:02,316
I never thought I'd hear them
used to describe me.

215
00:13:04,583 --> 00:13:08,000
I couldn't even say a word
at your house earlier.

216
00:13:09,250 --> 00:13:10,884
It doesn't feel real.

217
00:13:13,041 --> 00:13:17,083
I kept thinking, "What am I even hearing?"

218
00:13:17,291 --> 00:13:18,632
I'm so sorry.

219
00:13:21,083 --> 00:13:22,225
You...

220
00:13:24,416 --> 00:13:26,666
should never have had to hear
those things.

221
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:31,075
I don't know what to say.

222
00:13:39,666 --> 00:13:43,666
You're not going to leave me, right?

223
00:13:50,957 --> 00:13:52,398
I'll try to stay strong.

224
00:13:53,883 --> 00:13:55,065
I'm sorry.

225
00:14:47,041 --> 00:14:51,255
I'm sorry, Joong Bin.
My daughter's so frail.

226
00:14:52,125 --> 00:14:55,738
General, your wife's neurosis
has been getting worse.

227
00:14:56,507 --> 00:15:00,174
Dad, I'm scared of mom.

228
00:15:08,833 --> 00:15:10,375
(DNA Test Report)

229
00:15:12,666 --> 00:15:15,124
(Analysis Result, Mismatch)

230
00:15:15,125 --> 00:15:19,416
(Im Joong Bin, Im Ji Hu, Mismatch)

231
00:15:46,307 --> 00:15:48,523
Stop drinking.

232
00:15:49,666 --> 00:15:51,317
Ji Hu still isn't home.

233
00:15:53,625 --> 00:15:54,662
What should we do?

234
00:15:55,322 --> 00:15:56,916
He didn't go to Ji Ni's again, did he?

235
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,083
Should I go drag him back?

236
00:15:58,333 --> 00:15:59,454
Why...

237
00:16:00,689 --> 00:16:03,083
are you so determined
to make this marriage happen?

238
00:16:03,125 --> 00:16:04,625
Why are you acting like this too?

239
00:16:05,457 --> 00:16:07,707
Of course it's for Ji Hu.

240
00:16:07,833 --> 00:16:09,761
And for you too.

241
00:16:09,762 --> 00:16:11,666
You're old-fashioned
and obsessed with having kids.

242
00:16:11,732 --> 00:16:15,690
That's right.
I did say I wanted lots of kids.

243
00:16:18,416 --> 00:16:21,125
He can move out all he wants,
but he's still your son.

244
00:16:21,791 --> 00:16:24,381
He's grown, so there's no need to worry.

245
00:16:25,916 --> 00:16:29,875
No, Do Hee's staying here.
He needs to come home.

246
00:16:31,500 --> 00:16:32,791
I'm going to rest.

247
00:16:33,125 --> 00:16:34,744
Okay. Go lie down.

248
00:16:46,982 --> 00:16:49,149
You gave birth to him, understand?

249
00:16:49,783 --> 00:16:51,152
You're not infertile.

250
00:16:51,528 --> 00:16:54,533
You're just like any other girl.

251
00:16:55,708 --> 00:16:59,875
Raise him as your own child.
Never let Joong Bin find out.

252
00:16:59,958 --> 00:17:01,150
This is giving me a headache.

253
00:17:14,333 --> 00:17:16,583
What?

254
00:17:16,741 --> 00:17:18,533
She's in Ji Hu's room right now.

255
00:17:18,632 --> 00:17:21,632
I saw her coming out of his room
this morning. It gave me chills,

256
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,369
so I came to the clinic early.

257
00:17:24,416 --> 00:17:26,625
Honestly, I'd leave home too, if I could.

258
00:17:27,791 --> 00:17:29,416
Ji Hu moved out.

259
00:17:29,458 --> 00:17:32,357
I don't even want to hear about that jerk.

260
00:17:32,358 --> 00:17:34,291
Do Hee's living in that house?

261
00:17:34,666 --> 00:17:37,250
Yeah, she registered their marriage.

262
00:17:38,958 --> 00:17:42,166
So Ji Ni must've made up her mind.

263
00:17:42,791 --> 00:17:45,926
She said she was taking the day off
instead of going to work,

264
00:17:45,927 --> 00:17:48,500
and it sounded like
she was going to break up with Ji Hu.

265
00:17:48,833 --> 00:17:50,208
She said the same thing to me.

266
00:17:51,375 --> 00:17:52,708
Good.

267
00:17:52,916 --> 00:17:54,624
You should tell her,
"You did the right thing,"

268
00:17:54,625 --> 00:17:57,583
and urge her to break up with him
and meet someone else.

269
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,416
If I had the money,
I'd send her abroad to study.

270
00:18:03,041 --> 00:18:05,309
I have nothing to say.

271
00:18:07,125 --> 00:18:12,625
But even though it was a holiday,
Mai didn't come.

272
00:18:13,208 --> 00:18:15,250
She doesn't seem
to have visited O Reum, either.

273
00:18:15,375 --> 00:18:17,791
I was hoping she would too.

274
00:18:20,125 --> 00:18:25,000
Seung Woo may be loud and brash,
but he's affectionate.

275
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:29,041
But Seung Hyun...

276
00:18:30,125 --> 00:18:34,000
It's nice seeing him here too,
after seeing him at home.

277
00:18:34,916 --> 00:18:37,338
- Seung Hyun...
- Yeah, I know.

278
00:18:38,166 --> 00:18:39,500
Are you really going to do this?

279
00:18:39,625 --> 00:18:40,833
Might as well give it a try.

280
00:18:41,291 --> 00:18:45,047
It's not like I'm investing a fortune,
and I like staying active.

281
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:49,250
Why throw away a perfectly good job
to do this?

282
00:18:49,666 --> 00:18:52,416
Hey, Yeong Ju, I've got to go,
so I'll head out first.

283
00:18:53,166 --> 00:18:54,749
- See you at home later.
- Take care.

284
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,708
- Bye, Jung A.
- You're both here?

285
00:18:57,500 --> 00:18:58,666
- You're here.
- Yes.

286
00:18:58,708 --> 00:19:00,553
- Come on in.
- Take care.

287
00:19:03,125 --> 00:19:05,216
- I'll show you how to use the machine.
- Okay.

288
00:19:05,625 --> 00:19:08,833
When you first come in,
turn on the register first.

289
00:19:10,374 --> 00:19:11,499
Yes, Counselor.

290
00:19:12,333 --> 00:19:13,409
My address?

291
00:19:13,875 --> 00:19:15,443
No, I left home.

292
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:19,541
I understand.

293
00:19:22,166 --> 00:19:23,208
What are you doing?

294
00:19:24,166 --> 00:19:25,930
I was just talking to the lawyer.

295
00:19:26,583 --> 00:19:28,291
I sent over the dashcam footage
you gave me.

296
00:19:28,333 --> 00:19:29,500
Everything okay?

297
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:32,458
There's a problem.
I need to change my address to your place.

298
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:35,333
Hey, your dad's really going to lose it
if you do that.

299
00:19:42,458 --> 00:19:45,458
Why would you have that delivered here?

300
00:19:45,541 --> 00:19:47,203
Are you really going to countersue?

301
00:19:47,833 --> 00:19:49,207
Mother, seriously.

302
00:19:49,392 --> 00:19:52,651
They said accepting it will improve
my chances of winning the lawsuit.

303
00:19:53,831 --> 00:19:55,623
If I receive the lawsuit here,

304
00:19:55,625 --> 00:19:58,708
it proves I'm living
under the same roof as Ji Hu.

305
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:40,174
I wish my parents were still alive
to see this.

306
00:20:40,208 --> 00:20:43,750
My beautiful Yeong Ju,
making mung bean pancakes.

307
00:20:45,125 --> 00:20:49,375
My mom always wanted
a son-in-law just like you, Sa Bin.

308
00:20:49,708 --> 00:20:52,916
If she were still alive,
she'd carry you around on her back.

309
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,541
Our mom had a bad back.
She couldn't carry him.

310
00:20:59,583 --> 00:21:01,000
Typical siblings.

311
00:21:01,833 --> 00:21:05,708
Since Sun Kyung's not here,
I'll call you my brother-in-law.

312
00:21:05,875 --> 00:21:07,958
Please treat your sister well.

313
00:21:11,067 --> 00:21:13,358
Mother, look at this.

314
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:17,166
What's all this? Why so much...

315
00:21:18,166 --> 00:21:20,083
My mother...

316
00:21:20,125 --> 00:21:21,833
Please think kindly of me.

317
00:21:22,166 --> 00:21:24,791
You should've been living
like this all along.

318
00:21:26,375 --> 00:21:27,958
Why did you bring so much?

319
00:21:32,682 --> 00:21:37,016
Ji Hu, where have you been?
Why are you only showing up now?

320
00:21:37,458 --> 00:21:38,625
Ji Hu.

321
00:21:38,708 --> 00:21:40,291
You had the lawsuit papers delivered here.

322
00:21:41,125 --> 00:21:44,458
But I told the lawyer
we're not living together.

323
00:21:57,482 --> 00:21:58,941
You're staying at Tae O's place?

324
00:22:00,391 --> 00:22:03,349
The trial starts next week.
I won't give up, no matter what.

325
00:22:05,083 --> 00:22:07,750
The more I think about it,
the crueler it seems.

326
00:22:08,166 --> 00:22:09,583
As you know, Ji Ni...

327
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,898
has been deeply hurt
by her mom's unhappy marriage.

328
00:22:13,375 --> 00:22:15,666
Telling someone like that
she's just like her mom...

329
00:22:18,549 --> 00:22:20,132
I'm so disappointed in you, Dad.

330
00:22:21,033 --> 00:22:24,574
It'd be like someone telling my child,
"You'll be abandoned."

331
00:22:26,883 --> 00:22:28,258
I won't make excuses.

332
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:32,024
Who else knows what you just told me?

333
00:22:32,208 --> 00:22:35,041
Just you, me, and Ji Ni.

334
00:22:35,083 --> 00:22:37,375
Then don't tell anyone else. Ever.

335
00:22:37,832 --> 00:22:39,416
I have to protect your mom.

336
00:22:40,041 --> 00:22:44,041
She couldn't bear knowing
that you and I were aware of it.

337
00:22:44,333 --> 00:22:46,875
So you didn't know either?

338
00:22:48,307 --> 00:22:50,390
By the time I got back from sea,
you were already born.

339
00:22:50,625 --> 00:22:51,875
Then when did you...

340
00:22:52,974 --> 00:22:55,724
- Did my birth mother tell you too...
- No.

341
00:22:56,132 --> 00:22:58,299
I found out when your maternal grandmother
was dying.

342
00:22:58,366 --> 00:23:00,616
Your mom was born
with a uterine condition.

343
00:23:04,166 --> 00:23:05,581
We'll talk about this later.

344
00:23:06,541 --> 00:23:08,875
We need to deal with the problem
at hand first.

345
00:23:10,333 --> 00:23:11,375
As for the trial...

346
00:23:13,224 --> 00:23:15,683
I'll try to get Do Hee to drop it herself.

347
00:23:16,274 --> 00:23:17,954
She won't listen to anyone.

348
00:23:18,289 --> 00:23:19,629
We'll have to go to trial.

349
00:23:29,666 --> 00:23:30,833
It's me, Ji Ni.

350
00:23:32,583 --> 00:23:36,458
You've been cooped up in your room
for days. Aren't you going stir-crazy?

351
00:23:39,824 --> 00:23:41,400
I came for two reasons.

352
00:23:42,249 --> 00:23:45,916
First, things are going smoothly
with the trial preparations.

353
00:23:46,750 --> 00:23:50,625
And second, my dad agreed to help us.

354
00:23:52,991 --> 00:23:56,908
I told him I knew I was adopted.

355
00:23:58,316 --> 00:24:02,399
To my dad, my mom and his reputation
mean everything.

356
00:24:04,190 --> 00:24:08,024
I think he wants to stop me
from telling my mom too.

357
00:24:11,750 --> 00:24:15,956
Ji Ni, I miss you so much.

358
00:24:52,041 --> 00:24:53,198
Ji Hu.

359
00:24:58,083 --> 00:24:59,642
I'm sorry I upset you.

360
00:25:02,083 --> 00:25:05,267
Have you been making this
in your room all this time?

361
00:25:11,366 --> 00:25:13,158
It looks like you.

362
00:25:16,482 --> 00:25:17,829
I have a gift for you too.

363
00:25:19,846 --> 00:25:21,061
Just a second.

364
00:25:26,666 --> 00:25:27,708
Here.

365
00:25:29,250 --> 00:25:30,817
You lost the last one, remember?

366
00:25:30,885 --> 00:25:33,166
This time, there are two Js.

367
00:26:00,250 --> 00:26:01,558
Let's go visit your dad.

368
00:26:01,918 --> 00:26:04,625
We couldn't visit during the holiday,
so we should pay our respects.

369
00:26:04,874 --> 00:26:06,374
It's our first visit since he passed away.

370
00:26:16,999 --> 00:26:19,207
I got these to leave at his memorial tree.

371
00:26:20,698 --> 00:26:22,448
I was going to go alone
if you didn't come out.

372
00:26:31,083 --> 00:26:32,750
I missed you too.

373
00:26:34,125 --> 00:26:35,687
Introduce me to your dad.

374
00:26:37,156 --> 00:26:38,333
I'd like to pay my respects.

375
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:07,740
Honey, I'm sorry
we couldn't come for Chuseok.

376
00:27:10,032 --> 00:27:11,824
I ended up coming alone.

377
00:27:12,458 --> 00:27:14,396
Ji Ni won't leave her room.

378
00:27:14,806 --> 00:27:16,875
All she does is make dolls.

379
00:27:19,507 --> 00:27:20,757
Isn't that funny?

380
00:27:22,166 --> 00:27:25,833
I kept telling her to fall in love
and start dating.

381
00:27:27,333 --> 00:27:28,458
Honey,

382
00:27:29,968 --> 00:27:32,708
how can I be a good mom?

383
00:27:33,583 --> 00:27:36,069
Ji Ni's in love for the first time,

384
00:27:36,904 --> 00:27:38,708
and I want to support her,

385
00:27:39,916 --> 00:27:41,833
but the situation is just awful.

386
00:27:43,291 --> 00:27:46,352
What would you do if you were me?

387
00:27:52,199 --> 00:27:54,366
Ji Hu, let's come another time.

388
00:27:55,541 --> 00:27:56,791
It's okay.

389
00:27:56,916 --> 00:27:58,000
Let's come another time.

390
00:27:58,083 --> 00:27:59,125
Ji Ni.

391
00:28:13,666 --> 00:28:15,958
Those little...

392
00:28:50,541 --> 00:28:53,874
(Family Register)

393
00:28:53,875 --> 00:28:56,457
I said no! I can't let you go!

394
00:28:56,458 --> 00:28:58,125
I can do this, Mother. Don't worry.

395
00:28:58,166 --> 00:28:59,500
I'll make sure Ji Ni never cries.

396
00:28:59,541 --> 00:29:01,791
This will show
that you bought my wedding gifts.

397
00:29:01,833 --> 00:29:02,958
Proof of a common-law marriage.

398
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,958
Don't tell me you've been won over
to Ji Ni's side.

399
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,041
I've changed my mind.

400
00:29:06,083 --> 00:29:09,082
She's a mistress.
She broke up someone else's family.

401
00:29:09,083 --> 00:29:11,458
She said the case was closed.
That's what his mom told me.

402
00:29:11,500 --> 00:29:13,291
You lied and said
the hit-and-run case was over?

403
00:29:13,333 --> 00:29:14,541
She came back again?

404
00:29:16,133 --> 00:29:18,133
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
